{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":162348,"duration_api_ms":156368,"num_turns":24,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"00e551f4-7d2a-4899-b41e-0c19305ce14a","total_cost_usd":0.8358374,"usage":{"input_tokens":11,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49328,"cache_read_input_tokens":482002,"output_tokens":5309,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49328,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":11,"outputTokens":5309,"cacheReadInputTokens":482002,"cacheCreationInputTokens":49328,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6820809999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":554,"outputTokens":4424,"cacheReadInputTokens":600249,"cacheCreationInputTokens":56846,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1537564,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"request_changes","evidence":["All 9 photosynthesis_dic tests pass: test_photosynthesis_consumes_dic, test_respiration_produces_dic, test_day_night_ph_swing, test_heavy_plant_load_larger_ph_swing, test_no_plants_minimal_ph_swing, test_photosynthesis_o2_dic_stoichiometry, test_respiration_o2_dic_stoichiometry, test_planted_lights_off_has_no_diurnal_ph_swing, test_planted_tank_day_night_cycle.","ProcessParams::default() correctly sets respiration_dic_rate_mg_c_per_g_per_hour = 0.01875 and photosynthesis_dic_rate_mg_c_per_g_per_hour = 0.075 (process.rs:316-317), with stoichiometric derivation comments (lines 313-315).","chemistry.rs hourly_chemistry_terms() applies photosynthesis DIC removal when light_on and respiration DIC production unconditionally, using the nonzero default rates.","plant_growth.rs and algae_growth.rs gate daily DIC withdrawal via hourly_photosynthesis_dic_enabled flag to prevent double-accounting between hourly and daily carbon paths.","All 21 chemistry tests pass, including the previously-failing nitrification_lowers_alkalinity_and_ph test.","All 24 budget_tracking tests pass, all 15 plant_algae_integration tests pass, all 6 nitrification_alkalinity tests pass.","tank_scenarios (9 tests) and tank_data (32 tests) all pass.","Clippy clean on tank_core (no warnings)."],"findings_or_gaps":["REGRESSION: `happy_plants_grow_with_light_and_nutrients` end-to-end test fails. Plants start at 12.000g (2 guilds × 6g from apply_named_scenario_tuning) and decline to 8.244g after 30 days. Root cause: this test uses StartupLightPreset::Hours10 (10h photoperiod), while the scenario default is now 12h. With the new DIC coupling active, 12g of plant biomass at 10h light on 12.5 mg C/L source water is carbon-limited: the daily DIC credit (0.075 × 12g × 10h = 9.0 mg C) cannot sustain maintenance + growth at that biomass. Either the per-guild tuning (6g) needs to be lower, or the test expectation needs adjustment, or the DIC credit calculation needs to account for the photoperiod mismatch.","FORMATTING: `cargo fmt --all --check` fails on crates/tank_core/tests/source_water_carbonate.rs (three formatting diffs). This should have been caught in validation."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["Fix the `happy_plants_grow_with_light_and_nutrients` regression. Options: (a) reduce per-guild plant tuning from 6g to a level sustainable at 10h photoperiod (e.g. 3-4g per guild); (b) change the test to use Hours12 matching the scenario default; (c) add water changes or CO2 injection to sustain the higher biomass. Option (a) is preferred since the 6g tuning was chosen for the DIC probe's 12h scenario, but the end-to-end test exercises a 10h variant.","Run `cargo fmt --all` to fix the formatting diff in source_water_carbonate.rs.","Rerun the full workspace test suite (`cargo test`) as final validation — the prior apply_fixes/plan_and_implement stages only ran targeted subsets and missed the end_to_end regression."]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"24785e06-774a-4eb0-b9e2-f755b91605d7"}
